# Roles Master Table Architecture

Transitioning from string-based roles in the [users](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Roles/app/Models/Role.php#19-26) table to a normalized Master Table architecture within the `Roles` module.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This change involves shifting from a [role](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/app/Models/User.php#32-39) string on the [User](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-frontend/src/types/auth.ts#8-16) model to a many-to-many relationship using a `role_user` pivot table. This is more extensible but changes how roles are queried (e.g., `$user->roles` instead of `$user->role`).

